flowchart LR
    PR[Pull request] --> DR[Dependency review]
    PR --> CQ[CodeQL]
    PR --> BT[Build and tests]
    DR --> IMG[Container image by digest]
    CQ --> IMG
    BT --> IMG
    IMG --> SBOM[SPDX SBOM]
    IMG --> PROV[Build provenance]
    SBOM --> ATTEST[Artifact attestations]
    PROV --> ATTEST
    ATTEST --> SUBJECT["Attested image subject + approved digest"]
    SUBJECT --> APPROVAL{Protected production environment approval}
    APPROVAL -->|approved| ACA[Already-existing Azure Container App]
